---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(281) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Pool Chemical Balancing in Spring, TX | Water Chemistry Experts" description="Precise pool chemical balancing in Spring, TX. Chlorine, pH, alkalinity, calcium, and CYA adjusted for safe, clear water and equipment protection.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Chemical Balancing</h1>
      <p>Accurate water chemistry that protects swimmers and equipment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>Proper chemical balance prevents algae, scale, corrosion, and skin irritation. We test comprehensively and dose carefully so your Spring pool stays within ideal ranges.</p>
      <h2>What We Balance</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Free and total chlorine (or bromine)</li>
        <li>pH and total alkalinity</li>
        <li>Calcium hardness</li>
        <li>Cyanuric acid (stabilizer)</li>
        <li>Salt levels for salt systems</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Why It Matters</h2>
      <p>Local water conditions and high evaporation rates in Texas shift chemistry quickly. Regular professional testing catches drift before it becomes expensive damage or an uncomfortable swim.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule a Water Test</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
